{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05118","headline":"塞北二首 二 · 沈佺期","name":"塞北二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"胡骑犯边埃，风从丑上来。\n五原烽火急，六郡羽书催。\n冰壮飞狐[冷]，霜浓候雁哀。\n将军朝授钺，战士夜衔枚。\n紫塞金河里，葱山铁勒隈。\n莲花秋劒发，桂叶晓旗开。\n秘略三军动，妖氛百战摧。\n何言投笔去，终作勒铭回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05118.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05118","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}